# Managed global (system) Git config for POSIX hosts (see
# .agents/instructions/git-scope-terminology.instructions.md). Symlinked as
# /etc/gitconfig by the posix-base.nix activation script, with a same-folder
# .bak backup of any system-owned original. Intentionally empty: signing,
# newline and symlink defaults are user-scoped in
# src/users/default/git/<host>.gitconfig.
